    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Una reseña de The Family Room",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "I saw the play The Family Room last night.",
       "alumno": "Anoche vi la obra The Family Room.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "It follows two sisters who meet again after ten years apart.",
       "alumno": "Trata de dos hermanas que se reencuentran después de diez años separadas.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The final scene is moving because the sisters remember the house where they grew up.",
       "alumno": "La escena final es conmovedora porque las hermanas recuerdan la casa donde crecieron.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The acting is excellent: the actors speak clearly and react naturally.",
       "alumno": "La interpretación es excelente: los actores hablan con claridad y reaccionan con naturalidad.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The first half feels slow. For example, it has three long conversations in the same room.",
       "alumno": "La primera mitad resulta lenta. Por ejemplo, incluye tres conversaciones largas en la misma habitación.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The plot is a little predictable because the audience can guess the ending early. I recommend it to people who enjoy family stories.",
       "alumno": "La trama es un poco predecible porque el público puede adivinar el final pronto. La recomiendo a quienes disfrutan las historias familiares.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
